- id: '2099534377428689251'
  text: 'The best AI-generated shot in the world doesn’t matter much if it doesn’t
    belong in the story.


    That’s why I like starting with a storyboard.


    GPT Image 2.5 is coming to CapCut PC through Design Studio and AI Image, giving
    you a way to establish the visual progression before generating the film.


    Then bring the storyboard into Video Studio and use Seedance 2.5 to create the
    video.


    After generation, use CapCut’s AI editing tools to work on how everything comes
    together.


    Because filmmaking isn’t just about making individual moments look good.


    It’s about making those moments work together.


    #GPTImage25 #CapCutPC #AIVideo #Seedance25'
